  tracks:
  - id: ridgeline
    displayName: Ridge Line
    scene: Course_RidgeLine
    description: 'A ridge trail above the pines: fast dirt, kickers, a cliff drop
      and boost pads that make you pick a line.'
    lengthKm: 0.9
    thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5222b1df96e9c420f8a1e511913d3897, type: 3}
    map: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31a561891b87f488aae29e18b2f12319, type: 3}
    loadingTips:
    - The trail steers with you. Lean into the stick to pick your line.
    - Boost pads sit left, middle or right. Pick your line early.
    - Hold Shift for boost on the ground. In the air, press it on the green.
    - Hold Space to crouch, let go at the lip for more air.
    - R puts you back on the trail.
  - id: dustdevil
    displayName: Dust Devil
    scene: Course_DustDevilGulch
    description: 'Down Main Street, out through the town gate and into a red canyon:
      under Devil''s Arch, through the narrows, up the quarry switchbacks and off
      the rim beside the old trestle.'
    lengthKm: 1.1
    thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e36cc2986574c4376a2b98cd34c3a623, type: 3}
    map: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36e2160e4b34e4f99baf269d85794e69, type: 3}
    loadingTips:
    - The mesa kicker at the gate launches you down the sweeper. Land it straight
      and keep your speed.
    - In the narrows the kicker sits left. Take it, or keep right for the clean line.
    - Brake before the quarry switchbacks. Three hairpins, then it's flat out along
      the rim.
    - The trestle drop is a lip, not a cliff. Crouch and pop it.
    - Hold Shift for boost on the ground. In the air, press it on the green.
    - Hold Space to crouch, let go at the lip for more air.
    - R puts you back on the trail.
  - id: cutlasscove
    displayName: Cutlass Cove
    scene: Course_CutlassCove
    description: Off the harbour quay onto white sand, past the wreck and through
      the sea arch, up into the jungle, along the fort's cannons and off the headland
      into Shanty Town.
    lengthKm: 0.9
    thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f1a00222750744f4aacfcc25d75c6ac6, type: 3}
    map: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4e9d43c1f655d4b10a3200a6c6c8cbac, type: 3}
    loadingTips:
    - Hop off the end of the quay onto the beach. The sand is fast.
    - The wreck kicker sits right of the line on the beach.
    - Up in the jungle the trail narrows under the trees. Hold your line.
    - At the fort the headland drops away. Crouch for the lip.
    - Hold Shift for boost on the ground. In the air, press it on the green.
    - Hold Space to crouch, let go at the lip for more air.
    - R puts you back on the trail.
  shows:
  - id: cloudbreak
    displayName: Cloudbreak
    scene: Show_Cloudbreak
    description: 'A summit run at sunset above a sea of cloud: balloons, turbines
      and a cable car across the valley, and the Summit Drop to finish.'
    lengthKm: 0.6
    thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 804109cb0ebe344f88b9c5d9c7e9bd92, type: 3}
    map: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 94c83c2b9f4b546b18de502100ce1472, type: 3}
    loadingTips: []
  - id: redrock
    displayName: Red Rock
    scene: Show_RedRockRodeo
    description: 'High noon on a mesa above a red canyon: the Wagon Gap, TNT Alley
      and the Canyon Drop, with a mine cart rattling over the trestle behind you.'
    lengthKm: 0.6
    thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4f912d0d75f984d20b92a9ccafe5bb06, type: 3}
    map: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b690afdd81c854be5a4e870c8eba9347, type: 3}
    loadingTips: []
  - id: cannonball
    displayName: Cannon Bay
    scene: Show_CannonballBay
    description: 'Golden hour on the cliffs above a turquoise bay: the Plank Walk,
      the Crow''s Nest and the Cliff Dive, with pirate ships sailing past below.'
    lengthKm: 0.5
    thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b38a5665b0774afe92c76c3a12e018a, type: 3}
    map: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 53639f743d8f845b482105be85aab111, type: 3}
    loadingTips: []
